WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:00.980
Three numbers.

2
00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.640
Miss one, and an investor
can end the meeting.

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:05.980
Your burn rate.

4
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.970
Your cost to get a customer.

5
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.400
Your margin.

6
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.260
I know people living in what
I call the fantasy world.

7
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.370
I have massive margins.

8
00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:14.960
Massive how much?

9
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.820
Then I look at the industry.

10
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.930
Is the market growing or shrinking?

11
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.600
Is your piece getting bigger?

12
00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.020
And before a joint venture
I do one thing first.

13
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.200
I read their financials.

14
00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:25.750
Then I call.

15
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.190
Ask like an owner, and
people see you differently.

16
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.180
You care about their company's health.

17
00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:32.820
Write your three numbers.

18
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.710
Then write the ones you don't know yet.

